{"id":"z4mrhug417b8xrwf89az6a7jn","title":"零售投资者对英伟达态度转淡","originalTitle":"Retail investors pull back on Nvidia after record buying spree","summary":"零售投资者在英伟达股价下跌时购入近20亿美元，但本周明显转向谨慎，减持股票多于增持。英伟达在11月12日的交易中录得创纪录的净流入1.11亿美元，但截至16日，已有8.9%的零售投资者减持，仅2.7%增持。英伟达将于17日公布第三季度财报，分析师已下调股价目标，担忧数据中心产品需求可能延迟。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Crypto Briefing"},"links":{"original":"https://cryptobriefing.com/retail-investors-pull-back-nvidia-record-buying/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T17:08:50.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-16T17:46:48.313Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-16T17:46:48.313Z","category":"stock-us","tags":["行情异动","半导体","NVIDIA"],"score":50,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"7dec1f76-e58f-4c0b-bc7f-bab852a715a5","title":"英伟达财报前遭零售投资者减持 股价承压及分析师下调目标价"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"Vivian Nguyen","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"7dec1f76-e58f-4c0b-bc7f-bab852a715a5","title":"英伟达财报前遭零售投资者减持 股价承压及分析师下调目标价"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nvidia","name":"NVIDIA / 英伟达"},{"slug":"semiconductor","name":"半导体"},{"slug":"crypto-market","name":"行情异动"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fu2-Spejvygw","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}